@startuml wf03_review
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam BackgroundColor white
|Editor|
start
:Open pending submission;
:Compare versions side by side;
if (Defect found?) then (yes)
  :Mark region and raise change request;
  repeat
    |Artist / Letterer|
    :Fix artwork and resolve change request;
    :Resubmit (new attempt,\nprevious becomes Superseded);
    |Editor|
    backward :Reopen change request;
  repeat while (Fix acceptable?) is (no) not (yes)
  :Verify change request;
endif
:Approve stage;
stop
@enduml
